 "notes": "Merged old 'Aquarium rocks and pebbles' and 'Other aquarium decoration' into Aquarium hardscape rock (Hobby Cork Trunk moved to driftwood). Substrate cut from 22 to 16 flat models plus 3 archetypes; dropped CaribSea Aquaculture Gravel, Coraline, Ocean Direct, Pyroflora, Aragamax Sugar-Sized Oolite, Super Naturals Aquascapes as SKU noise. Not added (no page retrievable: aquasabi, garnelio, Dennerle PDF failed): UNS Controsoil, Dennerle Scaper's Soil, ADA Do!aqua and Power Sand Special, Dennerle CO2 kits, ADA CO2 system. Dutch and jungle styles are plant-led layout styles, not owned objects; left as context (Aquascaping article). Live plants belong to the living-plants register (C3)."
